WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.682 --> 00:00:02.301
- So when they ask where a
leader is born, I know it,

00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:04.331
they're not really asking are they born?

00:00:04.331 --> 00:00:05.940
What they're really asking
is are there some people

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.274
when they're born they got it.

00:00:07.274 --> 00:00:11.107
Getting started is
absolutely the key to life.

00:00:12.297 --> 00:00:15.604
Dreams are free but the journey isn't.

00:00:15.604 --> 00:00:17.892
- Hello Believe Nation,
I'm Evan Carmichael.

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:20.469
My one word is believe and
I believe that entrepreneurs

00:00:20.469 --> 00:00:23.376
are going to solve all of
the world's major problems.

00:00:23.376 --> 00:00:25.100
So to help you on your journey,

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.909
today we're going to learn from
leadership guru, John Maxwell

00:00:27.909 --> 00:00:31.928
and my take on his top 10
rules for success, volume two.

00:00:31.928 --> 00:00:34.575
Rule number five is my
personal favorite and I'd love

00:00:34.575 --> 00:00:36.327
to know which one you guys like the best.

00:00:36.327 --> 00:00:38.328
And as always, as you're
listening, if something

00:00:38.328 --> 00:00:40.396
really resonates with
you, there's a message

00:00:40.396 --> 00:00:42.645
that really holds true to
you, please leave it down

00:00:42.645 --> 00:00:44.551
the comments below and put it in quotes

00:00:44.551 --> 00:00:46.396
so that other people can be inspired

00:00:46.396 --> 00:00:48.480
and when you write it
down, it's much more likely

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:51.019
to stick with yourself as well.

00:00:51.019 --> 00:00:52.510
Enjoy.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:55.074
(envelope whooshing)

00:00:55.074 --> 00:00:57.657
(upbeat music)

00:01:04.886 --> 00:01:06.908
- If I could just slowly
come off the stage

00:01:06.908 --> 00:01:10.124
and I can get real close to
you and we'll have kind of like

00:01:10.124 --> 00:01:12.291
a one on one conversation.

00:01:14.824 --> 00:01:16.167
There are two questions
that I would ask you

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:18.823
and the two questions I'm
about to ask you will really

00:01:18.823 --> 00:01:21.349
determine how successful you're
going to be in this business

00:01:21.349 --> 00:01:22.218
without any question.

00:01:22.218 --> 00:01:23.183
These are the two questions.

00:01:23.183 --> 00:01:24.871
It's not like there's
three or there's four

00:01:24.871 --> 00:01:26.310
or there's seven.

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:27.810
There's two, okay?

00:01:28.795 --> 00:01:29.882
Just trust me on this.

00:01:29.882 --> 00:01:31.977
I'm an old man, I know this.

00:01:31.977 --> 00:01:34.257
I've been around the block
a few times and there are

00:01:34.257 --> 00:01:36.333
two questions that if you're
going to answer in a positive

00:01:36.333 --> 00:01:38.703
way about yourself you're
going to be very successful.

00:01:38.703 --> 00:01:41.091
And if you really cannot
answer that in a positive way,

00:01:41.091 --> 00:01:43.700
to be honest with you, you're
not going to be near successful

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.450
as you would like to be.

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:48.505
The first question is very
simple, what are you doing

00:01:48.505 --> 00:01:50.971
to develop yourself?

00:01:50.971 --> 00:01:52.790
And if you say, by gosh
John, I tell ya right now,

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:54.134
I'm doing a lot to develop myself.

00:01:54.134 --> 00:01:57.673
I've got a personal growth plan
and I'm intentional in this

00:01:57.673 --> 00:02:00.366
and I'm doing this on a daily
deal, if you could say that

00:02:00.366 --> 00:02:02.673
to me then I'd say, hey,
we're in good shape here.

00:02:02.673 --> 00:02:05.554
We're in good shape
because that's the key.

00:02:05.554 --> 00:02:07.072
What are you doing to develop yourself

00:02:07.072 --> 00:02:11.029
and by the way, the reason
that's first is not because

00:02:11.029 --> 00:02:13.070
you want to be selfish,
it's kind of like almost

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:14.192
a selfish question.

00:02:14.192 --> 00:02:15.903
A person says, well, why
do I start with myself?

00:02:15.903 --> 00:02:18.387
The reason you start
with yourself is because

00:02:18.387 --> 00:02:23.232
you cannot give what you
do not have so you better

00:02:23.232 --> 00:02:25.050
with yourself.

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:27.087
Because if you're leading
others and have nothing

00:02:27.087 --> 00:02:28.771
to give them, nothing to share with them,

00:02:28.771 --> 00:02:32.521
nothing to teach them,
then I can promise you

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:39.080
you'll never be what you
want to be as a leader

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:41.382
and I could promise you that
after 40 years of personal

00:02:41.382 --> 00:02:44.537
growth, the secret of any
success if I've had any

00:02:44.537 --> 00:02:47.216
success at all, the secret
of that success has been

00:02:47.216 --> 00:02:50.953
personal growth of my life
and growth has literally

00:02:50.953 --> 00:02:52.662
placed me where I am.

00:02:52.662 --> 00:02:54.634
So what are you doing to develop yourself?

00:02:54.634 --> 00:02:55.976
It's a huge question.

00:02:55.976 --> 00:03:00.680
And, the 15 laws of personal
growth, basically these laws

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:04.770
are all about developing
yourself and developing

00:03:04.770 --> 00:03:08.937
the second question, what are
you doing to develop others?

00:03:10.706 --> 00:03:13.982
You see, on the first
question, you're foundational

00:03:13.982 --> 00:03:15.615
for your future.

00:03:15.615 --> 00:03:19.782
The second question is all about
compounding multiplication.

00:03:20.826 --> 00:03:22.700
That's where you build a huge business,

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:26.639
when you know how to develop other people.

00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:29.722
Passion often is linked with purpose.

00:03:32.111 --> 00:03:36.300
What I love to do is
often what I should do.

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:38.524
We have been created
within us the capacity

00:03:38.524 --> 00:03:42.220
to have things that we enjoy
greatly and a lot of times

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:44.243
there's a definite relationship between

00:03:44.243 --> 00:03:47.691
what I am in love with and
what I should be doing.

00:03:47.691 --> 00:03:49.996
We are created and wired in such a way

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:54.136
that passion and purpose
many times come together

00:03:54.136 --> 00:03:57.053
and passion is the great energizer.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:00.591
Once you have passion, you have energy.

00:04:00.591 --> 00:04:03.798
Once you find your passion,
you find your purpose.

00:04:03.798 --> 00:04:06.265
There is something energetic about it.

00:04:06.265 --> 00:04:08.594
You have never known a
person who was passionate

00:04:08.594 --> 00:04:10.067
that lacked energy.

00:04:10.067 --> 00:04:13.253
We talk about high energy
people, we talk about low energy

00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:16.437
people, there's no such thing
as like low energy people.

00:04:16.437 --> 00:04:17.732
Or high energy.

00:04:17.732 --> 00:04:20.751
If you have high energy, you have passion.

00:04:20.751 --> 00:04:23.832
If you have low energy,
you don't have any passion.

00:04:23.832 --> 00:04:25.945
Some people, they're already dead.

00:04:25.945 --> 00:04:27.677
They haven't made it official yet.

00:04:27.677 --> 00:04:30.569
(audience laughing)

00:04:30.569 --> 00:04:32.614
You just look at 'em, I
just want to walk around

00:04:32.614 --> 00:04:34.915
and do the committal,
let 'em watch and observe

00:04:34.915 --> 00:04:36.415
the whole process.

00:04:37.766 --> 00:04:40.119
But passion gives us a
great amount of energy

00:04:40.119 --> 00:04:42.282
and when we have that passion,
there's something about

00:04:42.282 --> 00:04:45.049
how we love what we're doing
and we enjoy what we're doing

00:04:45.049 --> 00:04:47.132
and passion energizes us.

00:04:48.451 --> 00:04:51.013
A person with passion always stands out.

00:04:51.013 --> 00:04:53.596
The world is so full of apathy.

00:04:55.822 --> 00:04:58.372
It's so full of average.

00:04:58.372 --> 00:05:00.455
It's so full of whatever.

00:05:01.753 --> 00:05:04.593
But once you have passion
and once you have a sense

00:05:04.593 --> 00:05:07.508
of energy in your life,
it just sets you apart.

00:05:07.508 --> 00:05:09.585
It distinguishes you.

00:05:09.585 --> 00:05:11.698
It already gives you what
I would call a head start

00:05:11.698 --> 00:05:13.753
in success of life.

00:05:13.753 --> 00:05:15.411
So when they ask where are leaders born?

00:05:15.411 --> 00:05:17.475
I know it, they're not
really asking are they born?

00:05:17.475 --> 00:05:19.306
What they're really asking
is are there some people

00:05:19.306 --> 00:05:21.308
when they're born, they got it?

00:05:21.308 --> 00:05:22.924
And some people when they're
born they don't got it.

00:05:22.924 --> 00:05:24.243
If you got it, you go to
the front of the line.

00:05:24.243 --> 00:05:25.753
If you don't got it, you
go to the back of the line.

00:05:25.753 --> 00:05:27.375
That's what they're asking.

00:05:27.375 --> 00:05:28.722
And I've got great news for you.

00:05:28.722 --> 00:05:30.541
And I do believe, I have
no question about it,

00:05:30.541 --> 00:05:32.301
that there are some people
that are born with what I call

00:05:32.301 --> 00:05:34.393
leadership leanings, no doubt about that.

00:05:34.393 --> 00:05:36.133
Just like some people are born with kind

00:05:36.133 --> 00:05:37.805
of a musical leaning.

00:05:37.805 --> 00:05:38.638
No doubt.

00:05:39.496 --> 00:05:41.477
But the great news is, because
I've done this for so long

00:05:41.477 --> 00:05:44.680
and I've done this with so
many over such a long period

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:47.483
of time in every country of the world,

00:05:47.483 --> 00:05:49.217
what I know is you can learn to lead.

00:05:49.217 --> 00:05:50.733
You can learn to lead.

00:05:50.733 --> 00:05:53.474
You can learn to be a better
leader than you are right now.

00:05:53.474 --> 00:05:56.047
You can grow as a leader.

00:05:56.047 --> 00:05:59.909
And if I'm a five as a leader,
that means my organization

00:05:59.909 --> 00:06:00.886
will be what?

00:06:00.886 --> 00:06:01.864
Talk to me.

00:06:01.864 --> 00:06:02.840
(audience chattering)

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:03.673
A four.

00:06:03.673 --> 00:06:04.506
Okay.

00:06:04.506 --> 00:06:05.339
Here we go.

00:06:05.339 --> 00:06:06.172
Because the lid, the
leadership lid won't allow it

00:06:06.172 --> 00:06:07.502
to go higher.

00:06:07.502 --> 00:06:08.335
So, how do I grow my organization?

00:06:08.335 --> 00:06:10.246
This is very simple folks.

00:06:10.246 --> 00:06:11.897
I've got to raise my lid, don't I?

00:06:11.897 --> 00:06:14.832
I've got to get this lid
up and because I can become

00:06:14.832 --> 00:06:16.780
a better leader, I can raise my lid.

00:06:16.780 --> 00:06:17.757
True?

00:06:17.757 --> 00:06:20.465
So I can go from a five to a six.

00:06:20.465 --> 00:06:21.382
To a seven.

00:06:23.305 --> 00:06:24.305
To an eight.

00:06:27.289 --> 00:06:28.122
To a nine.

00:06:30.048 --> 00:06:33.495
Now, this organization is a
four, when that leadership lid

00:06:33.495 --> 00:06:36.335
starts going up, that
organization goes from a four

00:06:36.335 --> 00:06:39.835
to a five to a six to a seven to an eight.

00:06:43.161 --> 00:06:48.059
You see, you're organization
will grow to the size

00:06:48.059 --> 00:06:50.309
of your leadership ability.

00:06:52.522 --> 00:06:54.648
Now if I were where you
are and I was listening

00:06:54.648 --> 00:06:57.074
to what I just said,
and I was taking notes,

00:06:57.074 --> 00:07:00.115
somewhere on my notes,
or somewhere on my iPad,

00:07:00.115 --> 00:07:02.241
I'd be putting a star right here.

00:07:02.241 --> 00:07:03.888
I'd be putting a rocket ship.

00:07:03.888 --> 00:07:08.055
I'd be putting a sign that
says, do not miss this.

00:07:12.496 --> 00:07:14.432
Because you're ability
to lead will determine

00:07:14.432 --> 00:07:19.000
how successful you'll be in
this house without any question.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:23.253
The best leaders will
build the biggest business.

00:07:23.253 --> 00:07:25.540
The whole concept, the whole
idea that you can learn to lead

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:27.624
and if you learn to lead
and the better you learn

00:07:27.624 --> 00:07:29.673
to lead, the more
successful you can become

00:07:29.673 --> 00:07:30.981
and the greater your business.

00:07:30.981 --> 00:07:32.134
This is an absolute fact.

00:07:32.134 --> 00:07:34.804
It's not a theory, it's not
a thought, it's not an idea,

00:07:34.804 --> 00:07:37.637
it's not a principal, it's a fact.

00:07:39.944 --> 00:07:43.463
And the law of the lid says,
the better you learn to lead,

00:07:43.463 --> 00:07:47.037
the higher you lift that lid,
the greater your business

00:07:47.037 --> 00:07:48.013
can become.

00:07:48.013 --> 00:07:49.851
Now, that's the law of the lid.

00:07:49.851 --> 00:07:51.912
I brought something with me
today that's very special.

00:07:51.912 --> 00:07:56.551
It's a kit and I'm just
so pleased to have this

00:07:56.551 --> 00:07:59.968
because this kit is very important to me.

00:08:01.306 --> 00:08:04.389
Now, it cost $799 and I got this kit,

00:08:05.715 --> 00:08:09.048
I got this kit back in the 1970's, okay.

00:08:11.978 --> 00:08:15.561
And, this was my first
personal growth kit.

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:21.227
It's Dynamics of Personal
Goal Setting by Paul Meyer,

00:08:22.449 --> 00:08:25.058
personal success planner
and I was so excited.

00:08:25.058 --> 00:08:26.431
It cost $799.

00:08:26.431 --> 00:08:30.598
Now, you have to understand,
I made about $800 a month.

00:08:32.858 --> 00:08:34.559
So get the picture.

00:08:34.559 --> 00:08:38.556
It took me six months to buy this kit.

00:08:38.556 --> 00:08:40.745
I saved up, we didn't have
credit cards back then

00:08:40.745 --> 00:08:43.915
and I just saved up and
worked hard and it took

00:08:43.915 --> 00:08:47.260
me six months before I had
enough cash to buy this kit

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:49.143
and I was so excited when I got it.

00:08:49.143 --> 00:08:53.419
And, I mean, I opened it all
up and this was just amazing.

00:08:53.419 --> 00:08:56.497
It had, I mean, you'll
just see some things here

00:08:56.497 --> 00:08:57.639
that will just crack you up.

00:08:57.639 --> 00:08:59.565
It had, for some of you
young people who've never

00:08:59.565 --> 00:09:01.417
