00:09:01.417 --> 00:09:04.417
(audience laughing)

00:09:14.114 --> 00:09:16.614
They're called cassette tapes.

00:09:19.687 --> 00:09:23.636
And I remember taking the
first cassette tape out,

00:09:23.636 --> 00:09:27.803
put it on my little cassette
player, opening this up,

00:09:29.007 --> 00:09:31.840
oh my gosh, this was so wonderful.

00:09:33.951 --> 00:09:35.695
That wasn't.

00:09:35.695 --> 00:09:37.200
(audience laughing)

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:40.195
They had, I mean, they
had page by page plans.

00:09:40.195 --> 00:09:42.921
And I mean, I went through
the plans and listened

00:09:42.921 --> 00:09:44.891
to the tapes, and go
through the plans and listen

00:09:44.891 --> 00:09:48.065
to the tapes and go through
the plans, listen to the tape.

00:09:48.065 --> 00:09:51.065
This was my first growth experience.

00:09:51.968 --> 00:09:54.385
And the ROI on this $799 kit,

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:05.903
it's worth millions of dollars to me.

00:10:07.356 --> 00:10:09.935
Yeah, you heard me right.

00:10:09.935 --> 00:10:11.602
Millions of dollars.

00:10:14.089 --> 00:10:17.422
And experiences and a lifetime of growth

00:10:19.663 --> 00:10:21.457
and what interesting is, now,

00:10:21.457 --> 00:10:23.113
here's what I want you to hear,

00:10:23.113 --> 00:10:26.945
the value of this kit,
the content was good,

00:10:26.945 --> 00:10:29.112
but that wasn't the value.

00:10:29.981 --> 00:10:32.853
The content was good but
as I looked back now,

00:10:32.853 --> 00:10:35.097
I said, what made this so special?

00:10:35.097 --> 00:10:37.352
What made this so special is very simple.

00:10:37.352 --> 00:10:40.352
This is the kit that got me started.

00:10:42.487 --> 00:10:44.240
Hear me out.

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:46.765
The value of what you do
for people is not so much

00:10:46.765 --> 00:10:50.117
